Article 1 (Enforcement Date)
This Decree shall enter into force on July 9, 2019; provided, the amended provisions of Article 42 (1) 1 and Appendix 9 shall enter into force on January 1, 2020; the amended provisions of Article 42 (1) 2 shall enter into force on the date specified in the following; and the amended provisions of Articles 4, 11 (2), and 42 (2), and Appendix 8 shall enter into force on the date of the promulgation of this Decree:
